      "body": "## What\n\nRead `UNBALANCED_MODEL_LOADING_TIMEOUT_S` from the environment instead of hardcoding it. Default stays 480, so nothing changes unless the variable is set.\n\n## Why\n\n```python\nUNBALANCED_MODEL_LOADING_TIMEOUT_S = 480  # leave more time for post data processing\n```\n\n480 s is generous for a local disk and short for a shared one. Four nodes pulling the same 539 GB bf16 checkpoint off one NFS export move about 2.1 TB between them; on a cold page cache one TP group did not reach `dist.monitored_barrier` inside the eight minutes, and the group was SIGQUIT'd with\n\n```\nTP rank 1 could finish the model loading, but there are other ranks that\ndidn't finish loading\n```\n\nThat message reads like a hang or an OOM and is neither — the node still had **2430 GB of its 3023 GB free** at the time. It was only slow.\n\nThe failure is also biased towards the configurations that need the loader most: the same checkpoint in FP8 is 274 GB and never came close to the limit. Only the bf16 path, which is what you fall back to when a quantised path is unavailable, hits it.\n\n## Behaviour\n\n| unset | 480 s, exactly as today |\n|---|---|\n| `SGLANG_UNBALANCED_MODEL_LOADING_TIMEOUT_S=3600` | four-node 539 GB cold load completes |\n\nOnce the page cache is warm the same load takes 290 s, well inside the default. The cold path is the one that decides whether the run starts at all.\n\n## Test\n\n* Default (unset): behaviour identical to before.\n* `SGLANG_UNBALANCED_MODEL_LOADING_TIMEOUT_S=3600`: four-node DeepSeek-V4-Flash BF16 load completes on cold NFS cache.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #34998595392](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/34998595392)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #34998595008](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/34998595008)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #34998595129](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/34998595129)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
